{
  "_note": "美债名义收益率曲线(美国财政部官方 CSV,收盘口径):mode=curve 出今天与约 1 个月前两条曲线 + 2–10 年利差;mode=spread 另出 2–10 年利差一年走势(26 个点)。「1 个月前 / 1 年前」= 往前 21 / 250 个交易日,对比日写在卡上。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "zh",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "语言:文案在取数层按语言出。切语言 = 整盘重取,数据缓存含 locale。没注入 @app 时按英文(overseas-first §2)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y0",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy)]"
      },
      "_note": "今年(按设备时区;跨年那几个小时差一天无妨:两年的文件都会取)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y1",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${y0}-1),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "去年。⚠️ 进 URL 的数字过 parseNumber(Android calc 返回 2025.0)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "modeIn",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${mode},curve)]"
      },
      "_note": "入参落地(勿删)。mode = curve(曲线)/ spread(利差走势)。"
    },
    {
      "action": "concurrent",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "nc",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://home.treasury.gov/resource-center/data-chart-center/interest-rates/daily-treasury-rates.csv/${y0}/all?type=daily_treasury_yield_curve&field_tdr_date_value=${y0}&page&_format=csv",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "string",
            "timeout": "10000",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable/1.0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "np",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://home.treasury.gov/resource-center/data-chart-center/interest-rates/daily-treasury-rates.csv/${y1}/all?type=daily_treasury_yield_curve&field_tdr_date_value=${y1}&page&_format=csv",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "string",
            "timeout": "10000",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable/1.0"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "当年 + 上一年两份,并发。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / concurrent 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(memory actionflow-concurrent-late-merge)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nok",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(findNotEmpty::(${nc},),Date),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "当年文件必须是 CSV(以列头 Date 开头);拿到的是错误页 / 空串 = 取数失败(G26),不许拿去年的数冒充最新。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${nok},1),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "treasury unavailable"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nokP",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(findNotEmpty::(${np},),Date),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${nokP},1),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "treasury (previous year) unavailable"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "要算「1 年前」/ 一年走势的流,上一年文件同样必需;缺了宁可失败(宿主贴上次成功的那帧),也不画半截。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nA",
        "value": "$[split::(${nc},\\n)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nP",
        "value": "$[split::(findNotEmpty::(${np},),\\n)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ndC",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(length::(${nA})-1),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "当年数据行数(第 0 行是列头;末尾空串已被 split 去掉)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rL",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(if::(le::(1,${ndC}),index::(${nA},1),index::(${nP},calc::(1-${ndC}))),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rM",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(if::(le::(22,${ndC}),index::(${nA},22),index::(${nP},calc::(22-${ndC}))),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rY",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(if::(le::(251,${ndC}),index::(${nA},251),index::(${nP},calc::(251-${ndC}))),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dL",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rL},\\,),0),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dM",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rM},\\,),0),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dY",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rY},\\,),0),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "L3m",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rL},\\,),4),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "M3m",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rM},\\,),4),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "L6m",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rL},\\,),6),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "M6m",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rM},\\,),6),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "L1y",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rL},\\,),7),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "M1y",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rM},\\,),7),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "L2y",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rL},\\,),8),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "M2y",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rM},\\,),8),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "L5y",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rL},\\,),10),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "M5y",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rM},\\,),10),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "L10y",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rL},\\,),12),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "M10y",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rM},\\,),12),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "L30y",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rL},\\,),14),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "M30y",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rM},\\,),14),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "Y2y",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rY},\\,),8),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "Y10y",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${rY},\\,),12),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "at",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(findNotEmpty::(${dL},)),9),connect::(subString::(${dL},0,2),-,subString::(${dL},3,5)),--)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t10",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${L10y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),parseNumber::(${L10y},0.00),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t2",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${L2y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),parseNumber::(${L2y},0.00),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "spv",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${L10y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${L2y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1)),round::(calc::((${L10y}-${L2y})*100)),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "spn",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${spv},__none__),__none__),0,1),1),parseNumber::(${spv},0),--)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "spT",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${spv},__none__),__none__),0,1),0),--,if::(gt::(${spv},0),+${spn},if::(lt::(${spv},0),−parseNumber::(calc::(0-${spv}),0),0)))]"
      },
      "_note": "利差带符号写:+48 / −35 / 0(单位「基点」在 RCN 里另一个 span)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "inv",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${spv},__none__),__none__),0,1),1),lt::(${spv},0)),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "倒挂 = 2 年 > 10 年(事实,不解读)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ysv",
        "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${Y10y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${Y2y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1)),round::(calc::((${Y10y}-${Y2y})*100)),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ysT",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ysv},__none__),__none__),0,1),0),--,if::(gt::(${ysv},0),+parseNumber::(${ysv},0),if::(lt::(${ysv},0),−parseNumber::(calc::(0-${ysv}),0),0)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dMtm",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${dM},/),0),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dMtd",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${dM},/),1),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dMt",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${zh},1),${dMtm} 月 ${dMtd} 日,index::(split::(Jan~Feb~Mar~Apr~May~Jun~Jul~Aug~Sep~Oct~Nov~Dec,~),calc::(${dMtm}-1)) ${dMtd})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dLtm",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${dL},/),0),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dLtd",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${dL},/),1),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dLt",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${zh},1),${dLtm} 月 ${dLtd} 日,index::(split::(Jan~Feb~Mar~Apr~May~Jun~Jul~Aug~Sep~Oct~Nov~Dec,~),calc::(${dLtm}-1)) ${dLtd})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dYy",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${dY},/),2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dYm",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(index::(split::(${dY},/),0),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dYt",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${dYy},__none__),__none__),0,1),0),,if::(eq::(${zh},1),${dYy} 年 ${dYm} 月,index::(split::(Jan~Feb~Mar~Apr~May~Jun~Jul~Aug~Sep~Oct~Nov~Dec,~),calc::(${dYm}-1)) ${dYy}))]"
      },
      "_note": "走势左端带年份(「2025 年 10 月」/「Oct 2025」):右端是「10 月 6 日」,不带年份两端会读成同一天。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cLo",
        "value": "$[min::(findNotEmpty::(${L3m},99),findNotEmpty::(${L6m},99),findNotEmpty::(${L1y},99),findNotEmpty::(${L2y},99),findNotEmpty::(${L5y},99),findNotEmpty::(${L10y},99),findNotEmpty::(${L30y},99),findNotEmpty::(${M3m},99),findNotEmpty::(${M6m},99),findNotEmpty::(${M1y},99),findNotEmpty::(${M2y},99),findNotEmpty::(${M5y},99),findNotEmpty::(${M10y},99),findNotEmpty::(${M30y},99))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cHi",
        "value": "$[max::(findNotEmpty::(${L3m},-99),findNotEmpty::(${L6m},-99),findNotEmpty::(${L1y},-99),findNotEmpty::(${L2y},-99),findNotEmpty::(${L5y},-99),findNotEmpty::(${L10y},-99),findNotEmpty::(${L30y},-99),findNotEmpty::(${M3m},-99),findNotEmpty::(${M6m},-99),findNotEmpty::(${M1y},-99),findNotEmpty::(${M2y},-99),findNotEmpty::(${M5y},-99),findNotEmpty::(${M10y},-99),findNotEmpty::(${M30y},-99))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cPad",
        "value": "$[max::(0.05,calc::((${cHi}-${cLo})*0.12))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cLo2",
        "value": "$[calc::(${cLo}-${cPad})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cRng",
        "value": "$[calc::(${cHi}-${cLo}+2*${cPad})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yL3m",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${L3m},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),calc::(round::(calc::((74-(${L3m}-${cLo2})/${cRng}*74)*100))/100),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yL6m",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${L6m},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),calc::(round::(calc::((74-(${L6m}-${cLo2})/${cRng}*74)*100))/100),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yL1y",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${L1y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),calc::(round::(calc::((74-(${L1y}-${cLo2})/${cRng}*74)*100))/100),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yL2y",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${L2y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),calc::(round::(calc::((74-(${L2y}-${cLo2})/${cRng}*74)*100))/100),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yL5y",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${L5y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),calc::(round::(calc::((74-(${L5y}-${cLo2})/${cRng}*74)*100))/100),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yL10y",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${L10y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),calc::(round::(calc::((74-(${L10y}-${cLo2})/${cRng}*74)*100))/100),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yL30y",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${L30y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),calc::(round::(calc::((74-(${L30y}-${cLo2})/${cRng}*74)*100))/100),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yM3m",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${M3m},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),calc::(round::(calc::((74-(${M3m}-${cLo2})/${cRng}*74)*100))/100),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yM6m",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${M6m},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),calc::(round::(calc::((74-(${M6m}-${cLo2})/${cRng}*74)*100))/100),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yM1y",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${M1y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),calc::(round::(calc::((74-(${M1y}-${cLo2})/${cRng}*74)*100))/100),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yM2y",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${M2y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),calc::(round::(calc::((74-(${M2y}-${cLo2})/${cRng}*74)*100))/100),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yM5y",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${M5y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),calc::(round::(calc::((74-(${M5y}-${cLo2})/${cRng}*74)*100))/100),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yM10y",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${M10y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),calc::(round::(calc::((74-(${M10y}-${cLo2})/${cRng}*74)*100))/100),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yM30y",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${M30y},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),calc::(round::(calc::((74-(${M30y}-${cLo2})/${cRng}*74)*100))/100),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cLPts",
        "value": "[0.0,${yL3m},28.1,${yL6m},56.2,${yL1y},84.3,${yL2y},121.4,${yL5y},149.5,${yL10y},194.0,${yL30y}]"
      },
      "_note": "折线点串给 line.points(普通内插,不进方法参数,逗号不用转义)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cMPts",
